Hi <%= @request.account&.first_name.presence || @request.guest_name.to_s.split(" ").first.presence || "there" %>,

Please find your invoice attached as a PDF.

Invoice: <%= @invoice_number %>
Analysis request: <%= @request.reference %> — <%= @request.title %>
Package: <%= @request.package_name %>
Amount: <%= @amount_aud %>
Issued: <%= @issued_on %>
Payment reference: <%= @payment_reference %>

<% if @invoice.status == "paid" -%>
This invoice is already marked as paid — thank you. No further action is needed.
<% else -%>
What happens next
-----------------
1. Pay the amount shown on the invoice, quoting <%= @payment_reference %>.
2. We mark the invoice paid as soon as the transfer clears.
3. Analysis work begins, and we email you when your report is ready.
<% end -%>

The attachment is a self-contained PDF copy of the invoice. Questions? Reply to
this email and the team will help.

